OL,7,FMeanwhile, PM Andy Burnham says the
OL,8,Fgovernment wants to get the welfare
OL,9,Fbill down "as quickly as possible" -
OL,10,Fearlier Downing Street said it is not
OL,11,Fsetting a "target or timetable" for
OL,12,Fwhen welfare spending will fall
OL,14,FChancellor John Healey delivered his
OL,15,Ffirst Budget as chancellor on Wednesday
OL,16,F- here's a quick guide to what was
OL,17,Fannounced
